    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab 3 of your friends and enter this cutesy and chaotic car chase! \u00a0Work together to fight off the oil enemies chasing you by shooting them with your bubble guns. If you stick together, you might be able to take down the looming Big Rig Behemoth - from the inside. Jump in, shoot the heart, and make a Clean Getaway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747920/extras/9c53de189c5c2677ef6beed108820bbc.avif?t=1748047940\" data-has-big width=800 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean Getaway is an award-winning 4-player couch co-op game. Your journey begins with Dr. Coney, a brilliant scientist who also happens to wear a traffic cone at all times. She\u2019s had her free clean energy source stolen by Big Oil, an evil hive mind of sentient oil led by the Big Rig Behemoth. As her appointed strike team, it\u2019s your job to get her research back and stop Big Oil once and for all \u2013 and maybe save Dr. Coney\u2019s missing wife along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747920/extras/31bf7c5be4c6f72f35de8f446fb02531.avif?t=1748047940\" data-has-big width=800 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shoot off various oil enemy types with different soap weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to tilt your car to steer away from incoming oil barrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience comedic animated cutscenes with voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your hyperspeed to zoom into the final battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Big Rig Behemoth in a boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 6 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete fast-paced collaborative puzzles as a team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Dr. Coney\u2019s wife from the clutches of Big Oil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sing along to a campfire song led by Dr. Coney</p></li></ul>",
