g Behemoth in a boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 6 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete fast-paced collaborative puzzles as a team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Dr. Coney\u2019s wife from the clutches of Big Oil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sing along to a campfire song led by Dr. Coney</p></li></ul>",
